      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Container rental order (W5041); customer relocation/return request
Frequency: Continuous; ~200–800 container moves/month at maturity
Volume: ~1 move per container order (deliver + eventual pickup)
Owner: Fleet/Logistics (VS-06) / Property Manager (Storage)
Participants: Logistics (VS-06), 3PL (VS-56), Driver, Customer Service (VS-13), Insurance (VS-26), Property Manager
Source: workflow W5045 — Portable/Mobile Container Delivery, Placement, Relocation &amp; Pickup Operations</bpmn:documentation>
