    <bpmn:process id="W_W5046" name="W5046. Customer Move-Out, Unit Inspection, Damage Assessment &amp; Final Settlement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Tenant move-out notice; end of lease; container return (W5045)
Frequency: Continuous; ~800–1,500 move-outs/month at maturity
Volume: 1 per vacating tenant/container
Owner: Property Manager (Storage) / O2C (VS-16)
Participants: O2C (VS-16), Property Manager, Facilities (VS-138), Customer Service (VS-13)
Source: workflow W5046 — Customer Move-Out, Unit Inspection, Damage Assessment &amp; Final Settlement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5046_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5046_Lane1" name="Property Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5046_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5046_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5046_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5046_Lane2" name="O2C">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5046_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5046_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5046_Start4" name="Tenant move-out notice; end of lease; container return (W5045)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5046_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5046_Task5" name="Schedule &amp; vacate: confirm move-out date, terminate access (W5043), and confirm…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Schedule &amp; vacate: confirm move-out date, terminate access (W5043), and confirm the unit is fully emptied/clean (or flag for lien if abandoned — W5047)
Responsible (R): Property Mgr
Accountable (A): Property Manager
Duration: Per move-out</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5046_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5046_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5046_Task6" name="Inspect &amp; damage-assess: compare move-in vs move-out condition (photos), assess…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Inspect &amp; damage-assess: compare move-in vs move-out condition (photos), assess damage (door/wall/lock/floor), and quote repair/cleaning charges against the deposit
Responsible (R): Property Mgr / Facilities
Accountable (A): Property Manager
Duration: Per move-out</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5046_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5046_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5046_Task7" name="Settle &amp; refund: apply deposit less damages (per lease W5038), process refund…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Settle &amp; refund: apply deposit less damages (per lease W5038), process refund (VS-16/O2C), issue final statement, and update occupancy (W5039) + churn analytics (W5054)
Responsible (R): O2C / Property Mgr
Accountable (A): O2C Manager / Property Manager
Duration: Per move-out</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5046_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5046_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5046_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5046_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5046_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-99 (ensure storage lien &amp; prohibited-goods control.) | - CTL-753: deposit settlement per lease (W5038); damage evidenced by photos (VS-88); refund within statutory/lease window
Owner: Property Manager (Storage) / O2C (VS-16)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
