    <bpmn:process id="W_W5048" name="W5048. Storage Customer Service, Complaint &amp; Inquiry Resolution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Tenant inquiry/complaint (billing, access, move-out, other); VOC
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~thousands of interactions/month at maturity
Owner: Property Manager (Storage) / Customer Service (VS-13)
Participants: Customer Service (VS-13), Property Manager, O2C (VS-16), Facilities (VS-138), Security (VS-23)
Source: workflow W5048 — Storage Customer Service, Complaint &amp; Inquiry Resolution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5048_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5048_Lane1" name="Customer Service">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5048_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5048_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5048_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5048_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5048_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5048_Start3" name="Tenant inquiry/complaint (billing, access, move-out, other); VOC">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5048_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5048_Task4" name="Intake &amp; triage: capture inquiry/complaint (omnichannel VS-13.1), classify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Intake &amp; triage: capture inquiry/complaint (omnichannel VS-13.1), classify (billing/access/damage/other), route to owner, and acknowledge within SLA (VS-13)
Responsible (R): Customer Service / Property Mgr
Accountable (A): Customer Service Manager
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5048_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5048_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5048_Task5" name="Resolve: address the issue (refund/repair/access-fix), coordinate with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Resolve: address the issue (refund/repair/access-fix), coordinate with O2C/Facilities/Security as needed, and confirm resolution with the tenant
Responsible (R): Customer Service / Property Mgr / SME
Accountable (A): Customer Service Manager / Property Manager
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5048_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5048_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5048_Task6" name="Close &amp; learn: record resolution/VOC (VS-13), feed CX analytics &amp;…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Close &amp; learn: record resolution/VOC (VS-13), feed CX analytics &amp; mystery-shopping (VS-146), and flag systemic issues for the program (W5054/W5056)
Responsible (R): Customer Service / Analytics
Accountable (A): Customer Service Manager
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5048_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5048_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5048_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5048_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5048_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-753 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Rental Lifecycle — Move-In, Access, Billing &amp; Move-Out (PA-174.2).) | - CTL-753: SLA + escalation (VS-13); refunds O2C-controlled (VS-16); systemic issues fed to program review (W5056)
Owner: Property Manager (Storage) / Customer Service (VS-13)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5048_Assoc9" sourceRef="W5048_Annotation8" targetRef="W5048_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
